     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜にさいして: at the moment of",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something is done at an important moment: noun + **に 際して**: **しゅっぱつ にさいして、 ごあいさつ を します** (when setting off, I say a few farewell words).",
      "It is very formal."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜にあたって: when doing / at the start",
     "texto": [
      "It is used when starting or preparing for an important act: noun + **にあたって**: **しゅっぱつ にあたって、 かぞく に あいさつ します** (before leaving, I say goodbye to my family).",
      "It is not simply a more natural version of **に際して**; both are formal, and the context decides."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
